# Optional. If GEMINI_API_KEY isn't set (or Gemini is unreachable/blocked), the
# agent runs entirely on a deterministic rule-based fallback (see
# app/interview/fallback.py) -- it still conducts a full, adaptive interview
# and produces structured feedback, just without LLM-generated phrasing.
#
# To enable LLM-generated questions with Google's free-tier Gemini API:
#   1. Go to https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   2. Sign in with a Google account and click "Create API key" -- no credit
#      card required for the free tier.
#   3. Set GEMINI_API_KEY below (locally) or as an environment variable on
#      your host (e.g. Render's dashboard -> Environment) -- never commit it.

GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest
